/*!
 * Customer retrieves their own order snapshot after placing an order through checkout.
 *
 * Test Steps:
 * 1. Authenticate as customer via POST /ecommerceMall/auth/customer/join
 * 2. Authenticate as admin via POST /ecommerceMall/auth/admin/join
 * 3. Create a category via POST /ecommerceMall/admin/categories
 * 4. Authenticate as seller via POST /ecommerceMall/auth/seller/join
 * 5. Create a product via POST /ecommerceMall/seller/products
 * 6. Create a product variant via POST /ecommerceMall/seller/products/{productId}/variants
 * 7. Add variant to cart via POST /ecommerceMall/customer/cartItems
 * 8. Checkout via POST /ecommerceMall/customer/checkout to create order
 * 9. Retrieve the order snapshot via GET /ecommerceMall/customer/orders/{orderId}/snapshots/{snapshotId}
 *
 * Validations:
 * - Verify snapshot contains immutable order state
 * - Verify order reference in snapshot matches the created order
 * - Verify snapshot timestamp is properly formatted
 */
