  /**
   * Retrieve a filtered and paginated list of refund requests.
   *
   * This operation allows authorized users (customers, sellers, administrators) to browse refund requests with comprehensive search capabilities.
   *
   * Customers can view their own refund requests with filters for status (pending, approved, rejected), date ranges, and associated order items. Sellers can view refund requests for their products with status filtering and response tracking. Administrators can view all refund requests across the platform with full filtering capabilities.
