   *
   * This endpoint returns order items belonging to the authenticated seller that have a status of 'paid' (payment confirmed but not yet shipped). These items are candidates for grouping into a new shipment. Sellers can use this endpoint to view all their pending order items before selecting which ones to include in a shipment.
   *
   * The response includes order item summaries containing essential information needed for shipment creation: the order item ID, associated product and variant details, quantity, price at purchase, and the parent order information. This allows sellers to identify which items belong to which orders when bundling items for shipment.
   *
   * Items are automatically filtered to only those with 'paid' status. Items in other statuses (shipped, delivered, cancelled, refunded) are excluded as they are either already processed or no longer eligible for shipping. The list is sorted by creation date with newest items first by default.
   *
   * Supports filtering by order ID to view all items from a specific order, by product ID to see items for a specific product, and by date range to narrow down recent orders.
   *
   * @param connection
   * @param body Search criteria and pagination parameters for filtering eligible order items
   * @x-autobe-authorization-type null
   * @x-autobe-authorization-actor seller
   * @x-autobe-specification Query ecommerce_mall_order_items table filtering by seller_id = authenticated seller ID and status = 'paid'.
   *
   * Join with ecommerce_mall_orders to get order details (order_number, recipient information).
   * Join with ecommerce_mall_products to get product name and main image.
   * Join with ecommerce_mall_product_variants to get variant SKU and options.
   * Support filtering by:
   * - orderId: Filter items belonging to a specific order
   * - productId: Filter items for a specific product
   * - createdAtFrom/createdAtTo: Date range filtering on order item creation
